    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752731952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752731952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752731952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/8fa59127d73213cbc1ad03046c990ebe.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span>Help the Turqu-chan escape from a mysterious organization </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that has captured her and modified her equipment into a horny style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turqu-chan, who often escapes, causing facility damage, has been given a suggestion by the researchers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she can clear the 15 stages set by the researchers, they will let her go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Turqu-chan successfully escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bdOverview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down perspective. Evading enemies and solving puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get caught by enemies, a Hentai pixel animation will be triggered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If energy drops below 50%, the Hentai pixel animation will also be triggered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are scenes where Turqu-chan can be caught when her energy is abundant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/ff77d335908a9b786b7c44255213e6ec.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/88b939b23e539d33dd1d60c1ef37ccef.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pixel animation combined with action puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 different H-scenes including mechanical and alien</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three distinct stage styles: mechanical, botanical, and biological</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Memory mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/8fa59127d73213cbc1ad03046c990ebe.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span>Help the Turqu-chan escape from a mysterious organization </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that has captured her and modified her equipment into a horny style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turqu-chan, who often escapes, causing facility damage, has been given a suggestion by the researchers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she can clear the 15 stages set by the researchers, they will let her go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Turqu-chan successfully escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bdOverview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down perspective. Evading enemies and solving puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get caught by enemies, a Hentai pixel animation will be triggered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If energy drops below 50%, the Hentai pixel animation will also be triggered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are scenes where Turqu-chan can be caught when her energy is abundant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/ff77d335908a9b786b7c44255213e6ec.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520890/extras/88b939b23e539d33dd1d60c1ef37ccef.avif?t=1752731952\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pixel animation combined with action puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 different H-scenes including mechanical and alien</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three distinct stage styles: mechanical, botanical, and biological</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Memory mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
